I totally agree with you on that one. Everyone uses the tools he can
best work with. Different people will favor different tools; a person
with great strength will favor a heavy hammer, while a person with less
strength will favor a light hammer. Still the choice of their tools
doesn't make those two persons different; they were already different in
the first place, which is why they use different tools. What kind of
person you are, affects what tools work best for you - not the other way
around.

